# NEXA environment configuration
# Copy this file to `.env` and fill in your own values.
#
# SAFETY RULES:
# - Only variables prefixed with EXPO_PUBLIC_ are bundled into the app and
#   visible to clients. NEVER put secrets (service role keys, admin tokens,
#   database passwords, private keys) in EXPO_PUBLIC_ variables or in code.
# - The Supabase `anon` key is designed to be public; `service_role` is NOT
#   and must only ever be used server-side (Edge Functions / admin dashboard).
# - `.env` is gitignored. Do not commit real values.

# Supabase
EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=
EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=